{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Robots: Unleashed (TRU)</strong> is a competitive 3D card battler set among the asteroid arenas orbiting the planet Rennova.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rookie Operator, you\u2019ll command a Mechommander, harness energy factions, and assemble Warbots from Scrap in short, skill-focused duels where every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast, Tactical Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches in TRU are designed to be quick but tense. The unique 3-Health system keeps the pressure high and makes every choice count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/f5b319041eb15283b28965124a8395a1.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=433 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/f5b319041eb15283b28965124a8395a1.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command Mechommanders and Factions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Mechommander and align with one of five energy factions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vitaus (Mechanical)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lysafar (Electrical)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civardus (Solar)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radixplor (Chemical)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignaeter (Nuclear)<br>Or remain Colorless for flexible tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction unlocks distinct synergies and strategies that change how you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash, Build, Deploy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack Scrap into HALT components (Head, Arms, Legs, Torso) to forge Warbots.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build patiently for stronger armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash early for powerful one-time Scrap effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy Biobots directly for surprise attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path leads to dramatic, cinematic robot combat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/b6d022865fdbf550def3718b83bf7f92.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/b6d022865fdbf550def3718b83bf7f92.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/b6d022865fdbf550def3718b83bf7f92.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic 3D Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRU brings card combat to life in a way you\u2019ve never seen. Watch towering Warbots collide, spark, and collapse into debris in full 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/924501935afc6482ee83b901deb29dcb.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/924501935afc6482ee83b901deb29dcb.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/924501935afc6482ee83b901deb29dcb.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fair, Competitive Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRU is built for competition, not pay-to-win. Unlock new cards, cosmetics, and trophies through play, then challenge your friends to duels or host your own matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI opponents are planned for quick solo play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/74d1d14a230c8e75ea7ce8f3f2a548b4.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/74d1d14a230c8e75ea7ce8f3f2a548b4.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/74d1d14a230c8e75ea7ce8f3f2a548b4.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Start of the Two Robots Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Robots: Unleashed is the foundation of a growing universe. Every win and every match statistic adds to your record and builds your prestige for what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core TRU experience is competitive card battles in 3D, fast, tactical, and free to play. But this is only the beginning. Future expansions will let you step aboard your own Dropship, explore the planet Rennova, and unlock immersive modes that extend beyond the asteroid arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/fedc77e903a4f68bb8f3eced810ebeed.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/fedc77e903a4f68bb8f3eced810ebeed.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/fedc77e903a4f68bb8f3eced810ebeed.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412340?t=1757426068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/7a16c27b48b6ce5c214a6319e1afbb9c969bbe02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757426068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/0a1563d0f27ae6be1c63af00931496d446635c84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757426068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/0a1563d0f27ae6be1c63af00931496d446635c84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757426068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Robots: Unleashed (TRU)</strong> is a competitive 3D card battler set among the asteroid arenas orbiting the planet Rennova.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rookie Operator, you\u2019ll command a Mechommander, harness energy factions, and assemble Warbots from Scrap in short, skill-focused duels where every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast, Tactical Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches in TRU are designed to be quick but tense. The unique 3-Health system keeps the pressure high and makes every choice count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/f5b319041eb15283b28965124a8395a1.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=433 height=250 ><sou