lass=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic 3D Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRU brings card combat to life in a way you\u2019ve never seen. Watch towering Warbots collide, spark, and collapse into debris in full 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/924501935afc6482ee83b901deb29dcb.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/924501935afc6482ee83b901deb29dcb.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/924501935afc6482ee83b901deb29dcb.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fair, Competitive Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRU is built for competition, not pay-to-win. Unlock new cards, cosmetics, and trophies through play, then challenge your friends to duels or host your own matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI opponents are planned for quick solo play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/74d1d14a230c8e75ea7ce8f3f2a548b4.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/74d1d14a230c8e75ea7ce8f3f2a548b4.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/74d1d14a230c8e75ea7ce8f3f2a548b4.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Start of the Two Robots Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Robots: Unleashed is the foundation of a growing universe. Every win and every match statistic adds to your record and builds your prestige for what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core TRU experience is competitive card battles in 3D, fast, tactical, and free to play. But this is only the beginning. Future expansions will let you step aboard your own Dropship, explore the planet Rennova, and unlock immersive modes that extend beyond the asteroid arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/fedc77e903a4f68bb8f3eced810ebeed.poster.avif?t=1757426068\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/fedc77e903a4f68bb8f3eced810ebeed.webm?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/fedc77e903a4f68bb8f3eced810ebeed.mp4?t=1757426068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Two Robots Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/7b4134d09e1029851e1816922dff9e2719ba66f6/header.jpg?t=1757426068","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257088885,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088885/movie480.mp4?t=1757347644","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088885/movie_max.mp4?t=1757347644"},"name":"Robots Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088885/b89b1e8694c924d8f82f61850c346760701e63c9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17573